{"body": "Households must meet certain eligibility requirements to receive SNAP benefits.\n\nBe prepared to provide this information when you apply:\n\nID card\n\nHousehold income and resources\n\nHousing costs\n\nCurrent monthly expenses\n\nIf applicable, immigration status", "citation_label": "Apply for SNAP: Monthly income limits for SNAP, Effective October 2025 (DHW page) 1", "citation_path": "us-id/guidance/dhw/apply-snap-income-limits/fy2026/block-1", "document_class": "guidance", "expression_date": "2025-10-01", "heading": "Apply for SNAP", "id": "915095ce-9055-5f33-a840-fca1437e2871", "jurisdiction": "us-id", "kind": "block", "language": "en", "level": 2, "metadata": {"block_count": 8, "caveat": "gross income limits only", "closure_elements": ["snap_s20"], "content_type": "text/html; charset=UTF-8", "discovered_via": "manual-review; needs-closure-2026-09-11 snap_s20", "document_subtype": "agency_program_page", "download_url": "https://healthandwelfare.idaho.gov/services-programs/food-assistance/apply-snap", "fiscal_year": "2026", "index_url": "https://healthandwelfare.idaho.gov/services-programs/food-assistance", "kind": "block", "primary_source": true, "program": "SNAP", "source_authority": "Idaho Department of Health and Welfare", "source_discovery_group": "us-id/guidance", "source_url": "https://healthandwelfare.idaho.gov/services-programs/food-assistance/apply-snap", "title": "Apply for SNAP: Monthly income limits for SNAP, Effective October 2025 (DHW page)"}, "ordinal": 1, "parent_citation_path": "us-id/guidance/dhw/apply-snap-income-limits/fy2026", "parent_id": "341f239c-c6d5-52b1-b648-653f38ea55b2", "source_as_of": "2026-09-14", "source_format": "html", "source_id": "us-id-dhw-apply-snap-income-limits-fy2026", "source_path": "sources/us-id/guidance/2026-09-14-snap-fy2026-state-transmittal/official-documents/us-id-dhw-apply-snap-income-limits-fy2026.html", "source_url": "https://healthandwelfare.idaho.gov/services-programs/food-assistance/apply-snap", 