{"body": "Download and complete an application\n\nThen submit completed application by either: Email: MyBenefits@dhw.idaho.gov Fax: 1-866-434-8278 (toll free) Mail: Self-Reliance Programs, PO Box 83720, Boise, ID 83720-0026\n\nYou must complete an interview along with the application. After your application is received and reviewed, you will be contacted for an interview.", "citation_label": "Apply for SNAP: Monthly income limits for SNAP, Effective October 2025 (DHW page) 3", "citation_path": "us-id/guidance/dhw/apply-snap-income-limits/fy2026/block-3", "document_class": "guidance", "expression_date": "2025-10-01", "heading": "Apply by mail, email or fax", "id": "74665ecd-a1bf-5d3b-a395-022939c6b44c", "jurisdiction": "us-id", "kind": "block", "language": "en", "level": 2, "metadata": {"block_count": 8, "caveat": "gross income limits only", "closure_elements": ["snap_s20"], "content_type": "text/html; charset=UTF-8", "discovered_via": "manual-review; needs-closure-2026-09-11 snap_s20", "document_subtype": "agency_program_page", "download_url": "https://healthandwelfare.idaho.gov/services-programs/food-assistance/apply-snap", "fiscal_year": "2026", "index_url": "https://healthandwelfare.idaho.gov/services-programs/food-assistance", "kind": "block", "primary_source": true, "program": "SNAP", "source_authority": "Idaho Department of Health and Welfare", "source_discovery_group": "us-id/guidance", "source_url": "https://healthandwelfare.idaho.gov/services-programs/food-assistance/apply-snap", "title": "Apply for SNAP: Monthly income limits for SNAP, Effective October 2025 (DHW page)"}, "ordinal": 3, "parent_citation_path": "us-id/guidance/dhw/apply-snap-income-limits/fy2026", "parent_id": "341f239c-c6d5-52b1-b648-653f38ea55b2", "source_as_of": "2026-09-14", "source_format": "html", "source_id": "us-id-dhw-apply-snap-income-limits-fy2026", "source_path": "sources/us-id/guidance/2026-09-14-snap-fy2026-state-transmittal/official-documents/us-id-dhw-apply-snap-income-limits-fy2026.html", "source_url": "https://healthandwelfare.idaho.gov/services-programs/food-assistance/apply-snap", "version": "2026-09-14-snap-fy2026-state-transmittal"}
{"body": "A household must meet the following eligibility requirements:\n\nMust be a citizen or legal immigrant\n\nMust be an Idaho resident\n\nYour household income must be less than the program income limits for your household size\n\nWith some exceptions, you must work or participate in an employment and training program\n\nFor most households, resources must be under $5,000 to qualify for SNAP. Resources include, but are not limited to:\n\nCash\n\nBank accounts\n\nStocks and bonds\n\nProperty\n\nHousehold and recreational vehicles\n\nHouseholds can receive SNAP benefits from only one state at a time. If you have recently moved to Idaho, you must end your SNAP benefits in your previous state, prior to applying for SNAP in Idaho.", "citation_label": "Apply for SNAP: Monthly income limits for SNAP, Effective October 2025 (DHW page) 4", "citation_path": "us-id/guidance/dhw/apply-snap-income-limits/fy2026/block-4", "document_class": "guidance", "expression_date": "2025-10-01", "heading": "Eligibility", "id": "9ecf8da2-4a36-57af-8a8f-a97ec081f9e3", "jurisdiction": "us-id", "kind": "block", "language": "en", "level": 2, "metadata": {"block_count": 8, "caveat": "gross income limits only", "closure_elements": ["snap_s20"], "content_type": "text/html; charset=UTF-8", "discovered_via": "manual-review; needs-closure-2026-09-11 snap_s20", "document_subtype": "agency_program_page", "download_url": "https://healthandwelfare.idaho.gov/services-programs/food-assistance/apply-snap", "fiscal_year": "2026", "index_url": "https://healthandwelfare.idaho.gov/services-programs/food-assistance", "kind": "block", "primary_source": true, "program": "SNAP", "source_authority": "Idaho Department of Health and Welfare", "source_discovery_group": "us-id/guidance", "source_url": "https://healthandwelfare.idaho.gov/services-programs/food-assistance/apply-snap", "title": "Apply for SNAP: Monthly income limits for SNAP, Effective October 2025 (DHW page)"}, "ordinal": 4, "parent_citation_path": "us-id/guidance/dhw/apply-snap-income-limits/fy2026", "parent_id": "341f239c-c6d5-52b1-b648-653f38ea55b2", "source_as_of": "2026-09-14", "source_format": "html", "source_id": "us-id-dhw-apply-snap-income-limits-fy2026", "source_path": "sources/us-id/guidance/2026-09-14-snap-fy2026-state-transmittal/official-documents/us-id-dhw-apply-snap-income-limits-fy2026.html", "source_url": "https://healthandwelfare.idaho.gov/services-programs/food-assistance/apply-snap", "version": "2026-09-14-snap-fy2026-state-transmittal"}
{"body": "Effective October 2025\n\nHOUSEHOLD SIZE INCOME 1 $1,696 2 $2,292 3 $2,888 4 $3,483 5 $4,079 6 $4,675 7 $5,271 8 $5,867 EACH ADDITIONAL MEMBER + $596", "citation_label": "Apply for SNAP: Monthly income limits for SNAP, Effective October 2025 (DHW page) 5", "citation_path": "us-id/guidance/dhw/apply-snap-income-limits/fy2026/block-5", "document_class": "guidance", "expression_date": "2025-10-01", "heading": "Monthly income limits for SNAP", "id": "137bb76c-3e90-5c14-9c76-effd36054943", "jurisdiction": "us-id", "kind": "block", "language": "en", "level": 2, "metadata": {"block_count": 8, "caveat": "gross income limits only", "closure_elements": ["snap_s20"], "content_type": "text/html; charset=UTF-8", "discovered_via": "manual-review; needs-closure-2026-09-11 snap_s20", "document_subtype": "agency_program_page", "download_url": "https://healthandwelfare.idaho.gov/services-programs/food-assistance/apply-snap", "fiscal_year": "2026", "index_url": "https://healthandwelfare.idaho.gov/services-programs/food-assistance", "kind": "block", "primary_source": true, "program": "SNAP", "source_authority": "Idaho Department of Health and Welfare", "source_discovery_group": "us-id/guidance", "source_url": "https://healthandwelfare.idaho.gov/services-programs/food-assistance/apply-snap", "title": "Apply for SNAP: Monthly income limits for SNAP, Effective October 2025 (DHW page)"}, "ordinal": 5, "parent_citation_path": "us-id/guidance/dhw/apply-snap-income-limits/fy2026", "parent_id": "341f239c-c6d5-52b1-b648-653f38ea55b2", "source_as_of": "2026-09-14", "source_format": "html", "source_id": "us-id-dhw-apply-snap-income-limits-fy2026", "source_path": "sources/us-id/guidance/2026-09-14-snap-fy2026-state-transmittal/official-documents/us-id-dhw-apply-snap-income-limits-fy2026.html", "source_url": "https://healthandwelfare.idaho.gov/services-programs/food-assistance/apply-snap", "version": "2026-09-14-snap-fy2026-state-transmittal"}
{"body": "After you have submitted your application, you will receive a notice from DHW regarding your eligibility.\n\nIf you are approved for SNAP, you will either receive your EBT card the same day in our office, or by mail within 10-14 days.\n\nEach month that you are eligible, your card will be automatically loaded with your benefits. Benefits are loaded on a staggered schedule the first 10 days of the month. The date your SNAP benefits will be loaded, depends on the last number of your birth year. If you were born in 1994, you will receive benefits on the 4th day of the month.", "citation_label": "Apply for SNAP: Monthly income limits for SNAP, Effective October 2025 (DHW page) 6", "citation_path": "us-id/guidance/dhw/apply-snap-income-limits/fy2026/block-6", "document_class": "guidance", "expression_date": "2025-10-01", "heading": "After application submission", "id": "17d55ef8-4155-59de-9368-d5ffa6450107", "jurisdiction": "us-id", "kind": "block", "language": "en", "level": 2, "metadata": {"block_count": 8, "caveat": "gross income limits only", "closure_elements": ["snap_s20"], "content_type": "text/html; charset=UTF-8", "discovered_via": "manual-review; needs-closure-2026-09-11 snap_s20", "document_subtype": "agency_program_page", "download_url": "https://healthandwelfare.idaho.gov/services-programs/food-assistance/apply-snap", "fiscal_year": "2026", "index_url": "https://healthandwelfare.idaho.gov/services-programs/food-assistance", "kind": "block", "primary_source": true, "program": "SNAP", "source_authority": "Idaho Department of Health and Welfare", "source_discovery_group": "us-id/guidance", "source_url": "https://healthandwelfare.idaho.gov/services-programs/food-assistance/apply-snap", "title": "Apply for SNAP: Monthly income limits for SNAP, Effective October 2025 (DHW page)"}, "ordinal": 6, "parent_citation_path": "us-id/guidance/dhw/apply-snap-income-limits/fy2026", "parent_id": "341f239c-c6d5-52b1-b648-653f38ea55b2", "source_as_of": "2026-09-14", "